                <pb facs="0418" n="336" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg336"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 211.94/3.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-08-14"><hi rendition="#italic">August 14,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Governor-General Forbes asks me to cause arrest here and hold for extradition a
                    Filipino charged with murder. The Japanese Government requests me to state,
                    before acting, that the Philippine Islands are to be considered within our
                    extradition treaty.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">O’Brien.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
